  "original_reference_correction": "Catalogue text/216.bmp is a static fallback glyph, not the normally painted machinery. Original glyph export remains historical; do not read its fully opaque black font background as a solid wooden tile. All48actual Tiles/sw_axle_[1..3]_[suffix].png masks now inspected. Native fallback glyph remains unchanged.",
